> There's a book in the Storyteller Vault though called &quot;The Sorcerer's Companion&quot; that seems to be something of an update for Sorcerer Revised, including ways to use it in M20.. I haven't read it yet, but it certainly sounds good and might be worth checking out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2430-kalinara","name":"kalinara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2430_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"582"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T17:26:26-07:00","id":1402340,"title":"","content":"As Archivist said Hedge Magic is only found in HH2 and in W20 Kinfolk A breed apart. Iirc it whas said about sorcerers in M20 sourcebook that this would be something to look in earlier editions. Though from what I read at the wiki the staff in V20 and W20 is streamlined again like 2E in comparison to Revised that made it more complicated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-12T10:35:58-07:00","id":1402425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kalinara</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1402321-does-m20-or-something-like-that-include-a-conversion-for-sorcerer-hedge-magic?p=1402336#post1402336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, there isn't anything for hedge magic or sorcery in Mage 20. I think there's a sidebar that addresses it, but the gist is just that it was going to be too complicated to fit in an already very large book.<br /> <br /> There's a book in the Storyteller Vault though called &quot;The Sorcerer's Companion&quot; that seems to be something of an update for Sorcerer Revised, including ways to use it in M20.. I haven't read it yet, but it certainly sounds good and might be worth checking out.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Bought it' its what I was looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5685-archivist","name":"Archivist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5685_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"363"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}